  "prefLabel": "En 702.10 Sewage disposal system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 702.10 \"Sewage disposal system\" means the plant and property, including all pipes, pumps, structures, and other facilities and equipment owned, operated, and controlled or managed by a sewer utility in connection with the sewage disposal service to its customers.\n\nSource. #13912, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 700)",
